      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A relevant starting composition space combines refractory elements such as W, Mo, Ta, and Nb with lighter elements such as Al or Ti.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy has no dominant principal element.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-throughput screening can evaluate thousands of initial alloy compositions.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Integrating high-throughput screening, multiscale modeling, and experimental validation is an efficient alloy-discovery strategy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The screening should target a BCC matrix containing fine coherent precipitates.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Candidate alloys can be experimentally evaluated from ambient temperature to at least 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine coherent precipitates in a stable BCC matrix control dislocation motion and improve the strength-ductility balance.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent precipitate interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission and relieve stress concentrations that otherwise promote premature cracking.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "CALPHAD predicts phase equilibria and ordering tendencies across a large composition space.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8282813::chunk::000::abstract::a36e5ecf5a"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "CALPHAD-guided element and ratio selection can combine solid-solution strengthening with precipitation strengthening while avoiding brittle intermetallic compounds.",
